        {
          "text": "Kuciindi eco Hezekiya wakaciswa, wakali afwaafwi kufwa. Mpawo Isaya musinsimi mwana wa-Amozi wakamusikila, wakati, Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova. Bamba makani aako, nkaambo uzoofwa, tokoozoopona pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
