        {
          "text": "Jehova, koibaluka lino mbundakeenda kubusyu bwako mubuswini acamoyo uululeme, akucita zibotu mumeso aako. Nkabela Hezekiya wakalila akulila kupati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.3",
