        },
        {
          "text": "Pilu ka alimwi, ukaambile Hezekiya musolozi wabantu bangu kuti, Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova Leza wauso Davida. Ndamvwa mupailo wako, ndabona misozi yako, lino njookuponya, nkabela mubuzuba bwatatu uyoonjila muŋanda ya-Jehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
