                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Hezekiya wakutambula batumwa cakukondwa, wabatondezya iŋanda yoonse yazilondwedo zyakwe, ansiliva angolida azisyu amafuta mabotu aŋanda yazilwisyo zyakwe azintu zyoonse izyakajanwa muzilondwedo zyakwe. Katakwe cintu niciba cimwi muŋanda yakwe nimuba mubwami bwakwe Hezekiya ncaatakabatondezya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Isaya musinsimi wakasika kumwami Hezekiya, wamubuzya kuti, Aba bantu bakaambanzi? Bazwa kuli? Lino Hezekiya wakavuwa kuti, Bazwa kucisi cili kule, ku-Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
