              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakabuzya kuti, Ino ncinzi ncibabona muŋanda yako? Hezekiya wakavuwa kuti, Zintu zyoonse zili muŋanda yangu bazibona. Taakwe cintu niciba cimwi muzilondwedo zyangu ncindatabatondezya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
